# Rebuild containers after code changes

When you finish implementing code changes for Arkive (API and/or web), **always** rebuild and restart the affected Docker Compose services before ending the turn:

```bash
docker compose up -d --build api web
```

- Rebuild only the services you changed when possible (`api`, `web`, or both).
- Request permissions that allow access to the Docker socket (`all` if the sandbox blocks `/var/run/docker.sock`).
- Wait until the build finishes and containers are healthy/started.
- Tell the user they can hard-refresh **http://localhost:3080** to test.

Do not leave the user on stale images after UI or API work.
